TITLE: Define AppConfig Service with Effect-TS
DESCRIPTION: Defines a configuration service for the application using Effect-TS's `Config` module. It includes directory paths for source and processed files, with default values derived from environment variables or falling back to `process.cwd()`. This service is intended to be provided as a live layer.

