DESCRIPTION: Shows how to extract successful results (Right values) from a collection of Either types, discarding any failures (Left values). This pattern is common when dealing with operations that can fail, and you only want to aggregate the successful outcomes. It uses `filter` and `map` leveraging `Either.isRight` and accessing the `.right` property.

