TITLE: Define Notifier Service with Logger Dependency (TypeScript)
DESCRIPTION: Demonstrates defining a Notifier service that depends on a Logger service using Effect.Service. The NotifierLive layer's type signature, `Layer<Logger, never, Notifier>`, clearly documents this dependency, and `Effect.gen` is used for the implementation.

