TITLE: Dependency Injection with Layer and Effect.Service in Effect-TS
DESCRIPTION: Explains the idiomatic way to manage dependencies in Effect-TS using `Effect.Service` for defining services and `Layer` for providing implementations. Services are accessed within Effects using `yield* MyService`, avoiding global singletons or manual dependency passing.

