TITLE: Implement TestDatabaseService
DESCRIPTION: Provides a 'TestDatabaseService' implementation for testing purposes. This service uses a predefined array of test users and returns predictable results, including simulating a NotFoundError when a user ID is not found in the test data. This allows for isolated unit testing of components that depend on database operations.

