TITLE: Anti-Pattern: Using Live Dependencies in Tests
DESCRIPTION: This example illustrates an anti-pattern where tests rely on live service implementations (e.g., `EmailClientLive`) instead of mocks. This leads to integration tests that are slow, unreliable, and can have unintended side effects, such as sending actual emails.

